ÃVazha Pshavela (1861-1915) is considered one of the great poets in the fifteen-centuried Georgian literature. The three poems represented in the book are the most distinguished works of the poet."Ç
Ä"Reviews and Posthumous Assessments" for this edition collects eight new reviews of Thoreau's antislavery and late environmental essays as well as ofWalden. To the influential portraits of Thoreau by Ralph Waldo Emerson and James Russell Lowell, the Third Edition adds John Burroughs's "Another Word on Thoreau," his response to them and to his great predecessor. "Recent Criticism" includes eighteen selections of the best historical, political, philosophical, poststructuralist, and environmental criticism of Thoreau's writing since the mid-twentieth century. To classic pieces by E. B. White, Leo Marx, Barbara Johnson, and Stanley Cavell, the Third Edition adds essays by nine new contributors, among them Laurence Buell, Laura Dassow Walls, Evan Carton, Robert A. Gross, Albert J. von Frank, Steven Fink, and William Rossi A Chronology of Thoreau's life and work, new to the Third Edition, and an expanded and updated Selected Bibliography are also included."È
Åbakur sulakauris gamomc`eloba kale blumkvistis t`avgadasavlis meore cignis ganaxlebul, shevsebul gamoc`emas gt`avazobt`.
14 clis kale blumkvisti mocodebit` detek`tivia, magram, samcuxarod, arc` banditebit` savse ch`ikagoshi c`xovrobs da arc` londonis jurg'mulebshi... is mshoblebt`an ert`ad shvedet`is ert`i patara, ert`p`erovani da mosacqeni k`alak`is mkvidria, romelsac` sul ori k`uch`a da ert`i patara moedani ak`vs.
shesaz'loa gegonos, aba, aset` patara da miqruebul adgilas saintereso ra unda moxdeso. sxvat`a shoris, am k`alak`is mc`xovreblebsac` ase egonat` manam... sanam ak` sazareli mkvleloba ar moxda.
hoda scored ak` icqeba namdvili t`avgadasavali. mkvlelobis sak`me detek`tiv kale blumkvists ahqavs pirad kontrolze, t`umc`a gamoz'ieba gasaidumloebulia da polic`iis z'iebis paralelurad mimdinareobs. mihqevi z'iebis kvals da miadevne t`vali, rogor ipovis namdvil damnashaves 14 clis detek`tivi.
